  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assisted Voluntary Return and Reintegration Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports the voluntary return of migrants in situation of social and economic vulnerability, and contributes to their reintegration. IOM will assist migrants with pre-return information and counselling, travel arrangements, delivery of individual financial support before departure, will provide assistance at the departure airport, in-transit and upon arrival and reintegration in the country of origin tailored to migrants&apos; needs.</narrative>
  </description>
